    "freshness": {
      "kind": "stable"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "London rewards choosing a few areas rather than crossing the city for every landmark. Pair Westminster with a South Bank walk, save the Tower for another day, and leave space for one gallery. Your airport matters: a London city code is not a Heathrow booking."
    }
  },
